# Synthetic pipeline test fixture.
# A box with three DISTINCT edge lengths so any axis permutation or
# non-uniform distortion introduced by the conversion is obvious:
#   X extent = 1.0   Y extent = 2.0   Z extent = 3.0
# Authored Z-up (the "tall" 3.0 axis is Z) to exercise axis correction:
# a correct Y-up output must end up with the 3.0 extent on Y.
o testbox
v -0.5 -1.0 -1.5
v  0.5 -1.0 -1.5
v  0.5  1.0 -1.5
v -0.5  1.0 -1.5
v -0.5 -1.0  1.5
v  0.5 -1.0  1.5
v  0.5  1.0  1.5
v -0.5  1.0  1.5
f 1 2 3 4
f 5 8 7 6
f 1 5 6 2
f 2 6 7 3
f 3 7 8 4
f 4 8 5 1
